.TH RFID-VOICE-MEMO-ARM-NEXT 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-voice-memo-arm-next \- bind the next distinct card to voice memo mode
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-voice-memo-arm-next
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Waits for the next distinct RFID card, then binds it to the local voice memo
record/play workflow.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --scan-file " FILE"
Scan file to watch.
.TP
.BI --timeout " SECONDS"
Maximum wait time.
.TP
.B --force
Replace an existing binding.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-voice-memo (1),
.BR rfid-register (1)
